 * row: NODE_COMMENT (8) The node represents a comment in the XML document. A comment node cannot have any child nodes. A comment node can appear as the child of Document, DocumentFragment, Element, and EntityReference nodes.
 * source: corpus/learn/windows-ce-5.0/ms892577(v=msdn.10).html  borrowed from learn
 * derived: the #define keyword is not on the page
